64756.7 gpu: world feature feature=ssbump declared=17 visible=17 resolved=11 missing=6 first=WINTER/BLENDGRAVELTOGRASS_BAGEL resource=Metal/wall011d_bump-ssbump reason=$ssbump selects `BUMPMAP == 2`, where the texel is not a signed normal but three bumpBasis weights against three lightmap directions; this pass samples one lightmap and one tangent-space normal, so these materials are refused by name even when --world-material-bump is on
